8.69, 648.75, 648.93, 649.31], [658.24, 658.48, 658.66, 659.16, 659.88, 660.22]]}, "src": {"t": "I was not going to go be an ascetic and sit there and renounce everything. That just seems too unrealistic and too painful.", "a": "audio/t02/s14.mp3", "hl": [95, 106], "sp": "Naval", "oa": "audio/t02o/s14.mp3", "oab": [4.68, 6.51], "oas": ["audio/t02o/s14.mp3"], "zh": "我不会去当苦行僧，坐在那儿放弃一切。那太不现实，也太痛苦了。", "zb": [20, 23], "sg": [[0, 43, "audio/t02o/s14.mp3", 0.08, 2.24], [44, 90, "audio/t02o/s14.mp3", 2.24, 4.24], [91, 123, "audio/t02o/s14.mp3", 4.68, 6.51]]}}, {"n": 15, "w": "Buddha", "pos": "n.", "zh": "佛陀（释迦牟尼）", "ex": "The Buddha was a prince who left his palace to search for the meaning of life. Naval tells his story as the opposite path: giving up wealth first. Americans say BOO-duh.", "exs": ["There's a small Buddha statue in her studio.", "The story of the Buddha is about letting go."], "t": 669.95, "tt": {"w": 669.95, "ex": [["The", 672.75], ["Buddha", 672.75], ["was", 673.0], ["a", 673.26], ["prince", 673.36], ["who", 673.56], ["left", 673.84], ["his", 674.02], ["palace", 674.24], ["to", 674.52], ["search", 674.72], ["for", 675.06], ["the", 675.36], ["meaning", 675.46], ["of", 675.7], ["life.", 675.9], ["Naval", 676.86], ["tells", 677.12], ["his", 677.5], ["story", 677.78], ["as", 678.1], ["the", 678.42], ["opposite", 678.58], ["path:", 678.98], ["giving", 679.98], ["up", 680.2], ["wealth", 680.46], ["first.", 680.66], ["Americans", 681.78], ["say", 682.1], ["BOO-duh.", 682.8]], "exs": [[["There's", 686.61], ["a", 686.8], ["small", 686.88], ["Buddha", 687.25], ["statue", 687.62], ["in", 687.9], ["her", 688.22], ["studio.", 688.3]], [["The", 696.17], ["story", 696.27], ["of", 696.53], ["the", 696.83], ["Buddha", 696.93], ["is", 697.19], ["about", 697.73], ["letting", 697.93], ["go.", 698.25]]], "z": [689.42, 699.35], "r": [692.55, 701.99], "o": 705.77, "rx": [[692.55, 692.74, 692.82, 693.19, 693.56, 693.84, 694.16, 694.24], [701.99, 702.09, 702.35, 702.65, 702.75, 703.01, 703.55, 703.75, 704.07]]}, "src": {"t": "In the story of Buddha, he starts out as a prince and then he sees that it’s all kind of meaningless because you’re still gonna get old and die,", "a": "audio/t02/s15.mp3", "hl": [16, 22], "sp": "Naval", "oa": "audio/t02o/s15.mp3", "oab": [0, 1.3], "oas": ["audio/t02o/s15.mp3", "audio/t02o/s16.mp3"], "ft": "In the story of Buddha, he starts out as a prince and then he sees that it’s all kind of meaningless because you’re still gonna get old and die, and then he goes into the woods looking for something more.", "fhl": [16, 22], "zh": "在佛陀的故事里，他一开始是个王子，后来他发现这一切都有点没意义，因为人终究还是会老、会死，于是他走进森林，去寻找更多的东西。", "zb": [1, 3], "sg": [[0, 23, "audio/t02o/s15.mp3", 0, 1.3], [24, 42, "audio/t02o/s15.mp3", 1.3, 2.15], [43, 80, "audio/t02o/s15.mp3", 2.15, 4.47], [81, 144, "audio/t02o/s15.mp3", 4.47, 6.93], [145, 204, "audio/t02o/s16.mp3", 0, 2.75]]}}, {"n": 16, "w": "route", "pos": "n.", "zh": "路线；途径", "ex": "A route is a way to get somewhere, and here, a way to reach a goal in life. The happy route means the path that keeps him happy. Americans say both ROOT and ROWT.", "exs": ["I take the same route to work every day.", "There's more than one route to success."], "t": 717.02, "tt": {"w": 717.02, "ex": [["A", 719.6], ["route", 719.74], ["is", 719.96], ["a", 720.26], ["way", 720.34], ["to", 720.5], ["get", 720.66], ["somewhere,", 720.8], ["and", 721.1], ["here,", 721.58], ["a", 722.26], ["way", 722.42], ["to", 722.6], ["reach", 722.76], ["a", 722.96], ["goal", 723.14], ["in", 723.3], ["life.", 723.52], ["The", 724.52], ["happy", 724.64], ["route", 724.94], ["means", 725.2], ["the", 725.54], ["path", 725.86], ["that", 726.16], ["keeps", 726.52], ["him", 726.88], ["happy.", 727.24], ["Americans", 727.6], ["say", 728.16], ["both", 728.6], ["ROOT", 728.88], ["and", 729.66], ["ROWT.", 729.66]], "exs": [[["I", 733.08], ["take", 733.2], ["the", 733.4], ["same", 733.62], ["route", 733.86], ["to", 734.14], ["work", 734.59], ["every", 735.05], ["day.", 735.1]], [["There's", 742.98], ["more", 743.07], ["than", 743.27], ["one", 743.57], ["route", 743.79], ["to", 744.05], ["success.", 744.31]]], "z": [735.99, 745.49], "r": [739.12, 748.15], "o": 751.26, "rx": [[739.12, 739.24, 739.44, 739.66, 739.9, 740.18, 740.63, 741.09, 741.14], [748.15, 748.24, 748.44, 748.74, 748.96, 749.22, 749.48]]}, "src": {"t": "I’ll take the happy route that involves material success. Thank you.", "a": "audio/t02/s17.mp3", "hl": [20, 25], "sp": "Naval", "oa": "audio/t02o/s17.mp3", "oab": [0.08, 2.66], "oas": ["audio/t02o/s17.mp3"], "zh": "我还是选那条带着物质成功的快乐之路吧。谢谢。", "sg": [[0, 30, "audio/t02o/s17.mp3", 0.08, 2.66], [31, 68, "audio/t02o/s17.mp3", 2.66, 4.63]]}}, {"n": 17, "w": "involve", "pos": "v.", "zh": "包含；涉及", "ex": "To involve means to include something as a necessary part. A route that involves material success includes making money along the way. Very common in everyday English.", "exs": ["My job involves a lot of talking with clients.", "What does the training involve?"], "t": 757.33, "tt": {"w": 757.33, "ex": [["To", 760.43], ["involve", 760.63], ["means", 760.63], ["to", 761.02], ["include", 761.4], ["something", 761.72], ["as", 762.2], ["a", 762.58], ["necessary", 762.7], ["part.", 763.1], ["A", 764.32], ["route", 764.36], ["that", 764.6], ["involves", 764.9], ["material", 765.24], ["success", 765.86], ["includes", 766.46], ["making", 767.06], ["money", 767.74], ["along", 768.38], ["the", 768.5], ["way.", 768.76], ["Very", 769.74], ["common", 769.9], ["in", 770.4], ["everyday", 770.56], ["English.", 770.94]], "exs": [[["My", 774.81], ["job", 774.86], ["involves", 775.2], ["a", 775.8], ["lot", 776.18], ["of", 776.4], ["talking", 776.52], ["with", 776.84], ["clients.", 777.14]], [["What", 786.2], ["does", 786.4], ["the", 786.56], ["training", 786.74], ["involve?", 787.14]]], "z": [778.4, 788.36], "r": [781.74, 791.21], "o": 793.97, "rx": [[781.74, 781.79, 782.13, 782.73, 783.11, 783.33, 783.45, 783.77, 784.07], [791.21, 791.41, 79